  "releaseNotes": "Added StandardText.Infinity and used in relevant places. Also moved over ValueStatistics (peSHIr.Calculation) and DictionaryList (peSHIr.Collections) and tried to remove some documentation and nullability warnings from peSHIr.Sets. Really hope this will not cause use problems in Advin.Framework... (Still not everything is all documented and unit tested properly; this is still a work in progress, mostly for internal reuse for now. Also, the matrix code from https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/people/jammc with some extra usability wrappers still has not made the cut just yet.)",
